 e lobby up to the 12th floor. If you come late\, you can call Georgia at 5
 19 981 0360\nToronto\, ON\nCanada\n\nWhile developed nations enjoy proximi
 ty to frontier AI\, discussions of AI in the developing world are often ne
 glected.\n\nHow exactly does AI affect developing nations\, and what is th
 ere to do about it? In this talk\, Ashlyn Lu discusses stakeholders and pe
 rspectives of the Global South and emerging economies on frontier AI\, as 
